  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows three energy levels of an atom. Transitions between these levels result in the emission of photons. The frequency of the photon emitted in the transition from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=3\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=1\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{31}\"></span>, and the frequency of the photon emitted from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=1\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{21}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the frequency of the photon emitted during the transition from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=3\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{31} + f_{21}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{31} - f_{21}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{f_{31} \\cdot f_{21}}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f_{31} + f_{21}}{2}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
